        "Description": "展开死亡的羽翼，开始收人\rSpread the wing of death,reap the lives\r\r关卡目标：\r*在检查完杰夫的字条后，用爆炸事故消灭他\r*消灭周边的四个保镖，高级保安用爆炸事故消灭，度假村保安用消防斧消灭\r可选条件：\r*仅用套房内炉子造成爆炸事故\r\rThe Targets:\r*Eliminate Jeff by explosion after you inspect the note of Jeff\r*Eliminate 4 guards around No.2 suite,if the target is in black suit,eliminate them by explosion,otherwise eliminate them by fire axe\rOptional conditions:\r*Use the fireplace in the suite to cause the explosion accident",
